# Alternate integer widths index an array

Verifies narrow and arbitrary-width plain integer bindings both convert to
machine-word indexes and select their corresponding elements.

>>> source
let values: int[] = [10, 20, 30]
let narrow: int8 = 1
let wide: bigint = 2
print(values[narrow])
print(values[wide])

<<< stdout
20
30

<<< stderr
